<title>USA: U.S. INTEREST RATES MIXED IN LATEST WEEK.</title>
<headline>U.S. INTEREST RATES MIXED IN LATEST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Aug 8, compared with the Aug 1 week, as follows:</p>
<p>    Federal funds rate.................5.62 vs 5.57</p>
<p>    3-month Treasury bills.............5.15 vs 5.11</p>
<p>    3-month commercial paper...........5.56 vs 5.57</p>
<p>    3-month bankers acceptances........5.53 vs 5.51</p>
<p>    3-month CDs........................5.60 vs 5.58</p>
<p>    3-month Eurodollar.................5.56 vs 5.56</p>
<p>    30-year Government bond............6.52 vs 6.38</p>
</text>
